 into your townscaper  folder let me go on ahead and close this  out you want to go into your townscaper  folder and you want to make sure that  the original townscaper file is gone the  original tile palette file is gone go  into your backups and copy your new file  for for mines it would be green palette  so i'm gonna copy green palette and then  i'm gonna go to townscaper i'm gonna go  back to textures and i'm gonna paste it  make sure that you rename it because if  you don't rename it it's not going to  show up so you want to make sure that  you rename that file to town palette and  it's all one word make sure you get rid  of the space or otherwise townscaper  won't read it and it will generate a new  file for you and you'll have your  original colors so after we do that  we'll open townscaper and we'll check  out the results  [Music]  so this is what it looks like by the way  this is one of my favorite builds if you  want to see the original build i'll link  it in the description and maybe put it  in a card or something but yeah this is  it and i actually like this one better  to be honest with you it's just  something about the shades of green that  really draws you in if you enjoyed this  video please leave a comment please  share this video and please leave a like  as it would really help me out in the  youtube algorithm i would really really  appreciate it if this is your first time  here again thank you so much for  stopping by i hope that you enjoyed this  video and i hope it was enough to get  you to stick around and see what else i  got going on so with that being said  thank you thank you thank you and i will  see you guys next time  [Music]  bye

